<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Contents 10 0 R /Resources << /Font << /F1 15 0 R >> >> >>
endobj
10 0 obj
<< /Length 278 >>
stream
BT
/F1 12 Tf
72 700 Td
(Multi-Head Attention: Instead of performing a single attention function with d_model-dimensional keys, values and queries, we found it beneficial to linearly project the queries, keys and values h times with different, learned linear projections.) Tj
ET

endstream
endobj
